    {
      "name": "hmacSha256Verify",
      "reason": "an API RFC 4231 does not specify, since it defines the tag and not how one is checked; held by tests/link/crypto_hmac and tests/link/crypto_hmac_k1_verify, and the compare is timingSafeEqual, whose loop tests/cases/ct_asm_k1_ct.ts holds to no branch on the data after clang -O2 (docs/security/ct-verification.md, and docs/security/crypto-k1.md K1-8)"
    },
    {
